# Xboxx
### XBOX COMPILER TOOLCHAIN

<img alt="Xboxx neon logo" src="assets/branding/xboxx-logo.svg" width="520" />

**Research prototype · Windows x64 · C++20**

A research compiler/toolchain project targeting modern Xbox platforms, with a Windows x64 host for development, validation and diagnostics.

